  (text "J2, the wire pads: each takes a wire from the CN503 leg of the same name\n(odd pins = A1-A21, even pins = B1-B21). A17 (CD audio emphasis) and B2 stay unused;\nCN503's A22-A25 and B22-B25 (CD audio, +12 V) never come to this board."
    (at 213.36 176.53 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 537ad74e-f611-42fe-9aee-99be6c601960)
  )
  (text "JP1: the card runs from 3.3 V as made (pads 1-2 bridged).\nFor 5 V, cut the trace between 1 and 2 and bridge 2-3.\nJP2 open: the card is the slave (needed beside the GD-ROM drive)."
    (at 45.72 185.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid f0d075e4-ea56-4929-aecb-451584ef4f1c)
  )
  (text "True IDE mode: ATA SEL (pin 9) and A3-A10 grounded, WE (pin 36) held high.\nACT lights while the card asserts DASP (busy, or slave present at start-up)."
    (at 45.72 232.41 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2a82838a-6016-4567-b811-637eb299d1c9)
  )

